=== REASONING ===
1. ProjectedRangeData fields are in km (field names end _km). convertDistance expects miles input.
   → Convert km→miles via kmToMiles(), then apply convertDistance() for correct user-unit display.
2. Compact (cols<=1): WidgetBigNumber with Math.round(projectedRange), distanceUnit, health badge.
3. Standard (cols 2): Primary range AnimatedNumber + Badge + ComparisonBar (projected vs EPA/new range).
4. Wide (cols>=3): Same as standard + scrollable factors list derived from data fields:
   degradation_pct, avg_daily_km, current_capacity_pct, total_cycles.
5. healthBadge maps health_score to success/warning/error variant thresholds.
6. ComparisonBar uses projected/EPA ratio as % fill, color-coded green/amber/red.
7. All strings i18n via t('dashboard:widget.projectedRange.*').
8. Null safety: ?? operators on all data fields, useMemo with null checks.
9. Touch targets: min-h-[44px] on factor list rows. Compact uses WidgetBigNumber (centered, large text).
10. All freshness props forwarded to WidgetShell.
11. Registry: category='battery', Navigation icon, defaultSize 2×2, minSize 1×2, maxSize 3×40.

